  "reviews": [
    {
      "name": "places/ChIJW3mgWh_zaS4R6nTOcpRfyd0/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pBMVRWSjFXRFZxV214d1dqWTFaRWhCVTJwQ09FRRAB",
      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "a month ago",
      "rating": 5,
      "text": {
        "text": "i finally tried this small cafe shop just nearby! i thought they have some other pastries turns out it was just types of cheesecake shop (not a complaint!) i ordered the blueberry one….this ones SUPERB! i really love the flavor! it’s very rich, the blueberry, mixed with the cheese as a cake…YES! the second one i got was this biscoff one, it was gooood but im not a fan of it because its got some cinnamon in it (personal reference) and the latte was good. the space was not too big not too small, i came around 3pm on sunday, it was only 2 tables available. they also have the outdoor area! overall it’s 5/5. i might come back to try their main dishes!",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
      "originalText": {
