    {
      "name": "places/ChIJW3mgWh_zaS4R6nTOcpRfyd0/reviews/ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUN2ci1qYzJnRRAB",
      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "a year ago",
      "rating": 5,
      "text": {
        "text": "I've probably been here ten times because the place is comfortable and clean, almost all menus have been tried, sometimes the taste of the food is not consistent, but I recommend risol ayam keju, mac n cheese, matah chicken bowl, bitterballen, carrot cake, sus krakelin chocolate, and pie susu. The staff always greet you warmly and friendly, the parking lot is there but not big, waiting for orders is not long, there is a prayer room in the cafe.",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
      "originalText": {
